  "releaseNotes": "Loam 3.14.0: Loam.Pickers TimePicker editable text entry — set Editable to type a time into the field (mirrors DatePicker); committed on Enter/blur, parsed against TimeFormat then loosely (InvalidTimeText on failure). The clock icon becomes a button (Alt+Down also opens) and the flyout stays in sync. Public static TryParseTime exposes the parse rule. Additive, off by default. See https://araxis.github.io/loam/guide/changelog",
